      "content": "We must pivot the narrative from immediate margin loss to projected operational efficiency gains enabled *by* the compliance structure. Argue that the mandated upgrades under Tier 2 will drive specific AI/automation adoption, which the economic model predicts will yield a net efficiency gain exceeding the 12% compression within 36 months. This shifts the conversation from cost to mandated modernization, positioning the compliance as the *catalyst* for future profitability.",
      "source": "target",
